# Google Maps Platform API Key (Client-side Maps JavaScript API)
#
# Quickstart (Free Prototyping - No Billing / Cloud Project Required):
#   1. Open https://mapsplatform.google.com/maps-demo-key?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
#   2. Sign in with any Google account and accept the Maps Demo Project Terms.
#   3. Click to generate and reveal your Maps Demo Key.
#   4. Copy this file to `.env.local` and paste your key below.
#
# Production:
#   Provision an API key in Google Cloud Console with Maps JavaScript API,
#   Places API (New), and Elevation API enabled, and restrict it by HTTP referrer.
#   https://console.cloud.google.com/google/maps-apis/credentials?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0

VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_google_maps_api_key_here
